    <statement><p>Find a vector equation with parameter <m>t</m> for the line through the point <m>(6,0,-8)</m> and parallel to the vector <m>2\mathbf{i}-3\mathbf{j}+5\mathbf{k}.</m></p>
<p>Answer: <m>\mathbf{r}(t) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;6,0,-8\right&gt;+t\mathopen{}\left&lt;2,-3,5\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
